data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "timestamp": 1793185413215, "messageId": "cfea3c79c6", "delta": "Design A1 meets your requirements with 41 €/MWh for heating and 58 €/MWh for cooling. It covers 100% of both heat and cold demands, exceeding the 95% target. The system uses a brine at 86 °C reinjected at 30 °C. Components include an 8.09 MW heat exchanger, a 4.1 MW heat pump with a COP of 3.6, a 2 MW peak boiler, and chillers sized at 2 MW (absorption) and 2.5 MW (electric). Summer cooling extends doublet operation by 18.1%. This design costs 25.1 M€ capital and emits 82.2% less CO₂ than gas."}

data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_END", "timestamp": 1793185413215, "messageId": "cfea3c79c6"}

